---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---

<StarlightPage
  hasSidebar={false}
  frontmatter={{
    title: 'Creator Programme',
    description: 'How VISCERIUM credits, supports, and works with creative contributors.',
    tableOfContents: false,
    giscus: false,
  }}
>
  <div class="creator-programme-page">
    <section class="creator-hero" aria-labelledby="creator-hero-title">
      <span class="creator-hero__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="creator-shell creator-hero__inner">
        <h1 id="creator-hero-title">
          <span>Build something.</span>
          <span class="creator-hero__line-two">Keep your name on it.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="creator-hero__footer">
          <p>VISCERIUM is built as one coherent universe, with clear credit for the people who help create it.</p>
          <a class="creator-jump" href="#principles">See the terms <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creator-section" id="principles" aria-labelledby="creator-principles-title">
      <div class="creator-shell">
        <div class="creator-section__header">
          <h2 id="creator-principles-title">A few simple rules.</h2>
          <p>VISCERIUM keeps central ownership and editorial control. Contributors keep clear credit and work under agreed terms.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="creator-principles">
          <li>
            <span class="creator-number">01</span>
            <h3>Credit the maker.</h3>
            <p>Accepted creative work names the people responsible for it.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="creator-number">02</span>
            <h3>Agree before use.</h3>
            <p>Creative rights and usage terms are agreed before material is accepted.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="creator-number">03</span>
            <h3>Pay where agreed.</h3>
            <p>Substantial work may be commissioned, paid directly, or covered by another written agreement.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="creator-number">04</span>
            <h3>Canon stays curated.</h3>
            <p>Contribution does not make material canon automatically. VISCERIUM retains editorial control.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creator-section creator-section--participation" id="participation" aria-labelledby="creator-participation-title">
      <div class="creator-shell">
        <div class="creator-section__header">
          <h2 id="creator-participation-title">Different work. Different terms.</h2>
          <p>The agreement should match the contribution. Community input is not treated like commissioned art, writing, or sustained authorship.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="creator-tiers">
          <article class="creator-tier">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-tier__kind">Community</p>
              <h3>Suggestions and fixes</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Discussion, corrections, technical fixes, and feedback.</p>
            <p>Usually unpaid. Credit or thanks where appropriate.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="creator-tier">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-tier__kind">Contributor</p>
              <h3>Accepted creative work</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Lore, writing, artwork, maps, research, design, or similar work.</p>
            <p>Named credit and compensation where agreed.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="creator-tier">
            <div>
              <p class="creator-tier__kind">Partner</p>
              <h3>Sustained authorship</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Commissioned work or substantial ongoing collaboration.</p>
            <p>Individually negotiated terms.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creator-fund" id="fund" aria-labelledby="creator-fund-title">
      <div class="creator-shell creator-fund__inner">
        <div class="creator-fund__intro">
          <h2 id="creator-fund-title">Support beyond commissions.</h2>
          <div class="creator-fund__copy">
            <p>The Creator Fund is intended to give eligible creators another way to participate financially as the programme develops.</p>
            <p class="creator-note">The final structure and eligibility rules will be published when the scheme is ready.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="creator-support-log" aria-labelledby="creator-support-log-title">
          <div class="creator-support-log__header">
            <h3 id="creator-support-log-title">Creator support to date</h3>
            <p>Aggregate figures only. Individual compensation and contract terms remain private unless a creator chooses otherwise.</p>
          </div>

          <dl class="creator-support-metrics">
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Paid to creators</dt>
              <dd>Not published</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Creators supported</dt>
              <dd>Not published</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Creator Fund</dt>
              <dd>Launching</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-support-metric">
              <dt>Fund distributions</dt>
              <dd>Pending</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <p class="creator-support-log__note">Historic direct commissions are reported separately from formal Creator Fund distributions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</StarlightPage>

<style is:global>
  .creator-programme-page {
    --creator-bg: var(--sl-color-bg);
    --creator-surface: var(--codex-surface-raised-color);
    --creator-text: var(--sl-color-white);
    --creator-body: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    --creator-muted: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    --creator-void: var(--home-void);
    --creator-fixed-text: var(--home-text-fixed);
    --creator-fixed-body: var(--home-text-soft-fixed);
    --creator-wide: 118rem;
    --creator-gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 5.5rem);
    --creator-line: color-mix(in oklch, var(--codex-palette-deep) 72%, transparent);
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: clip;
    background: var(--creator-bg);
    color: var(--creator-body);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, .96rem + .15vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .creator-programme-page *,
  .creator-programme-page *::before,
  .creator-programme-page *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .creator-programme-page > section + section {
    margin-top: 0 !important;
  }

  .creator-programme-page :where(h1, h2, h3, p) {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }

  .creator-programme-page :where(h1, h2, h3) {
    color: var(--creator-text);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-synthesis-weight: none;
  }

  .creator-programme-page p {
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .creator-shell {
    width: min(100%, var(--creator-wide));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--creator-gutter);
  }

  .creator-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    min-block-size: calc(100svh - var(--sl-nav-height, 3.5rem));
    align-items: end;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--creator-void);
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .creator-hero__mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 48%;
    right: clamp(-15rem, -5vw, -3rem);
    z-index: -1;
    width: clamp(30rem, 64vw, 72rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1756 / 969;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--creator-fixed-text) 8%, transparent);
    -webkit-mask: url('/assets/brand/viscerium-logo.svg') center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: url('/assets/brand/viscerium-logo.svg') center / contain no-repeat;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .creator-hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    min-height: inherit;
    align-content: end;
    padding-top: clamp(7rem, 12vw, 12rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .creator-hero h1 {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 8.2vw, 8.8rem);
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    line-height: .9;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .creator-hero h1 > span {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .creator-hero__line-two {
    margin-top: .08em;
    font-size: .78em;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }

  .creator-hero__footer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--codex-palette-deep);
  }

  .creator-hero__footer p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, .98rem + .3vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .creator-jump {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-block-size: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .55rem;
    padding: .7rem .95rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--creator-fixed-text);
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text) !important;
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: background-color 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .creator-jump:hover,
  .creator-jump:focus-visible {
    background: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    color: var(--creator-void) !important;
  }

  .creator-section {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-section--participation {
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--creator-surface) 52%, var(--creator-bg));
  }

  .creator-section__header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, .85fr) minmax(24rem, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .creator-section__header h2,
  .creator-fund h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 1.8rem + 2.1vw, 4.6rem);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .creator-section__header h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .creator-section__header > p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-body);
  }

  .creator-principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .creator-principles > li {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 14rem;
    align-content: start;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-principles > li::marker {
    content: none;
  }

  .creator-number {
    color: var(--creator-muted);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .creator-principles h3,
  .creator-tier h3,
  .creator-support-log h3 {
    margin: 1rem 0 .75rem;
    color: var(--creator-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.12rem + .7vw, 2rem);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .creator-principles p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-body);
    font-size: .95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .creator-tiers {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-tier {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, .72fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: start;
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-tier__kind {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-muted);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .creator-tier h3 {
    margin-top: .45rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .creator-tier > p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-body);
    font-size: .96rem;
  }

  .creator-fund {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    background: var(--creator-void);
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
  }

  .creator-fund__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .creator-fund__intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, .85fr) minmax(24rem, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .creator-fund h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
  }

  .creator-fund__copy {
    max-width: 45rem;
  }

  .creator-fund__copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-body);
  }

  .creator-fund__copy p + p {
    margin-top: .8rem;
  }

  .creator-fund__copy .creator-note {
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  .creator-support-log {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-support-log__header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(18rem, .85fr) minmax(24rem, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 8rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .creator-support-log h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 1.3rem + .8vw, 2.3rem);
  }

  .creator-support-log__header > p {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-size: .9rem;
  }

  .creator-support-metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-support-metric {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 7.5rem;
    align-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--creator-line);
  }

  .creator-support-metric dt,
  .creator-support-metric dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .creator-support-metric dt {
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: .76rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .creator-support-metric dd {
    color: var(--creator-fixed-text);
    font-family: var(--vc-font-ui);
    font-size: clamp(.95rem, .9rem + .2vw, 1.08rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .creator-support-log__note {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--codex-palette-mid);
    font-size: .84rem;
  }

  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content :is(
    .creator-hero h1,
    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-principles h3,
    .creator-tier h3,
    .creator-fund h2,
    .creator-support-log h3
  ) {
    display: block;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--vc-font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-synthesis-weight: none;
  }

  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content :is(
    .creator-hero h1,
    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-principles h3,
    .creator-tier h3,
    .creator-fund h2,
    .creator-support-log h3
  )::before,
  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content :is(
    .creator-hero h1,
    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-principles h3,
    .creator-tier h3,
    .creator-fund h2,
    .creator-support-log h3
  )::after {
    content: none;
    display: none;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) {
    padding-top: 0 !important;
    padding-inline: 0 !important;
  }

  html[data-codex-mobile-header] .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) {
    padding-top: var(--sl-nav-height, 3.5rem) !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) div.content-panel:nth-child(1) {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane > main,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel > .sl-container,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .creator-programme-page {
    inline-size: 100% !important;
    max-inline-size: none !important;
    margin-inline: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) !important;
    column-gap: 0 !important;
    row-gap: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) > .codex-two-column-content > .codex-main-pane > main {
    grid-column: 1 / -1 !important;
    grid-row: 1 !important;
    min-inline-size: 0;
    padding: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel {
    padding: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) main > .content-panel > .sl-container,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content {
    padding-inline: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .sl-markdown-content {
    margin-block-start: 0 !important;
    padding-block: 0 !important;
  }

  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > .codex-header-fade-filter,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > .codex-header-figure,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > h1#_top,
  .main-frame:has(.creator-programme-page) .content-panel > .sl-container > .codex-breadcrumbs,
  body:has(.creator-programme-page) .codex-page-deck {
    display: none !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 86rem) {
    .creator-principles,
    .creator-support-metrics {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 70rem) {
    .creator-section__header,
    .creator-fund__intro,
    .creator-support-log__header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .creator-section__header h2,
    .creator-fund h2 {
      max-width: 16ch;
    }

    .creator-tier {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, .8fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 54rem) {
    .creator-hero__mark {
      right: -15rem;
      width: 42rem;
      opacity: .72;
    }

    .creator-hero__footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .creator-jump {
      width: fit-content;
    }

    .creator-tier {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: .75rem;
    }

    .creator-tier > p {
      max-width: 40rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .creator-principles,
    .creator-support-metrics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .creator-principles > li {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .creator-hero h1 {
      font-size: min(7.5vw, 3.5rem);
    }

    .creator-hero__line-two {
      font-size: .76em;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .creator-jump {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .creator-hero__mark {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
